  **MANOMAYA**      3   मनोमय      Mind/emotional     Viparyaya (misperception,
                                   layer              distortion)

  **VIJNANAMAYA**   4   विज्ञानमय   Wisdom/intellect   Pramāṇa (valid cognition)
