},

\"inner_meaning\": \"Dense material impulse → energetic agitation →
discriminative wisdom\",

\"outer_meaning\": \"Lord of the moon, cosmic protector, radiant
wholeness\",

\"ontology_layer\": \"UNIVERSAL\",

\"ontology_id\": 10,

\"smi\": 0.53,

\"tension\": \"MODERATE-HIGH\",

\"life_pattern\": 

\"Three-layer vertical journey from physical density through energetic
agitation to wisdom-seeking, 

pulled upward by cosmic/universal calling. Creates restless seeking
until integration.\"

}

**6.2 Example: "Love"**

